				</ukm:Metadata><Secondary><Body DocumentURI="http://www.legislation.gov.uk/nisi/1996/1320/body" IdURI="http://www.legislation.gov.uk/id/nisi/1996/1320/body" NumberOfProvisions="132" RestrictExtent="N.I." RestrictStartDate="2022-10-26"><Part DocumentURI="http://www.legislation.gov.uk/nisi/1996/1320/part/IV" IdURI="http://www.legislation.gov.uk/id/nisi/1996/1320/part/IV" NumberOfProvisions="42" id="part-IV" RestrictStartDate="2018-06-01"><Number>PART IV</Number><Title>FIXED PENALTIES</Title><Pblock DocumentURI="http://www.legislation.gov.uk/nisi/1996/1320/part/IV/crossheading/introductory" IdURI="http://www.legislation.gov.uk/id/nisi/1996/1320/part/IV/crossheading/introductory" NumberOfProvisions="5" id="part-IV-crossheading-introductory" RestrictStartDate="2016-12-08"><Title><Emphasis>Introductory</Emphasis></Title><P1group RestrictStartDate="2006-01-01"><Title>Fixed penalty offences</Title><P1 DocumentURI="http://www.legislation.gov.uk/nisi/1996/1320/article/57" IdURI="http://www.legislation.gov.uk/id/nisi/1996/1320/article/57" id="article-57"><Pnumber>57</Pnumber><P1para><P2 DocumentURI="http://www.legislation.gov.uk/nisi/1996/1320/article/57/1" IdURI="http://www.legislation.gov.uk/id/nisi/1996/1320/article/57/1" id="article-57-1"><Pnumber>1</Pnumber><P2para><Text>Subject to paragraph (3), for the purposes of this Part a “fixed penalty offence” is an offence specified in an order made under paragraph (2).</Text></P2para></P2><P2 DocumentURI="http://www.legislation.gov.uk/nisi/1996/1320/article/57/2" IdURI="http://www.legislation.gov.uk/id/nisi/1996/1320/article/57/2" id="article-57-2"><Pnumber>2</Pnumber><P2para><Text>The Department may by order specify as a fixed penalty offence for the purposes of this Part, any offence committed in respect of a vehicle, being an offence created under a statutory provision and punishable on summary conviction.</Text></P2para></P2><P2 DocumentURI="http://www.legislation.gov.uk/nisi/1996/1320/article/57/3" IdURI="http://www.legislation.gov.uk/id/nisi/1996/1320/article/57/3" id="article-57-3"><Pnumber>3</Pnumber><P2para><Text>Notwithstanding that an offence is specified by order under paragraph (2), it shall not be a fixed penalty offence for the purposes of this Part if it is committed—</Text><P3 DocumentURI="http://www.legislation.gov.uk/nisi/1996/1320/article/57/3/a" IdURI="http://www.legislation.gov.uk/id/nisi/1996/1320/article/57/3/a" id="article-57-3-a"><Pnumber>a</Pnumber><P3para><Text>by causing or permitting a vehicle to be used by another person in contravention of any provision made or restriction or prohibition imposed by or under any statutory provision,<CommentaryRef Ref="c1725595"/>. . . </Text></P3para></P3><BlockText><Para><Text><Emphasis>Sub‐para. (b) rep. by 1998 <Acronym Expansion="Northern Ireland">NI</Acronym> 7</Emphasis></Text></Para></BlockText></P2para></P2></P1para></P1></P1group></Pblock></Part></Body></Secondary><Commentaries><Commentary id="c1725595" Type="F"><Para><Text><Citation URI="http://www.legislation.gov.uk/1998/ni7" id="c00933" Class="NorthernIrelandOrderInCouncil" Year="1998" AlternativeNumber="7">1998 NI 7</Citation></Text></Para></Commentary></Commentaries></Legislation>